{"c":[{"id":"90e1c122d2365aa7","sum":"New helper script env names go in privacy-gate.ts processEnv()/HELPER_ONLY_ENV. Await PageFocus.moved in tests. Before loosening a fill guard, diff guard-adversary --verifier vs base. Value questions need askValues in hello; realfill-asks scores AskAsks.fallback as automatic.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"efc720c8ec4faf9a","sum":"host-env.test.ts scans only helper/src for process.env; privacy-gate.ts reads its gate names via processEnv() and HELPER_ONLY_ENV, so new script env names go there. Tests can await PageFocus.moved; EngineSession.onFocus discards that promise.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T094208Z-4d056099840ba76b","text":"host-env.test.ts scans only helper/src for process.env; helper/scripts/privacy-gate.ts still reads its build-gate names (CARET_INTERNAL_BUILD, CARET_*PRIVACY_RESOURCE) through processEnv() and HELPER_ONLY_ENV, so new script env names go there too.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T100347Z-137d3d2067c38ff7","text":"Tests can await PageFocus.moved for the walk/focus completion; EngineSession.onFocus discards that promise.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"49be5dc02d9c236a","sum":"G36: before loosening a fill guard, diff guard-adversary --verifier accepts vs base; oneOfSeveral blocks role-labelled people's phones. VS1: value questions reach only hellos declaring askValues beside askChoices; realfill-asks scores AskAsks.fallback as the automatic result.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T103008Z-ae509cb3a9a659fb","text":"G36: before loosening a fill guard, diff guard-adversary --verifier accept attempts vs base; oneOfSeveral also blocks role-labelled people's phones (recruiter: Wren Ng, ...). page-w3 1f flaked once in the full fast suite, passes alone.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T103634Z-919e960bf3dcead3","text":"VS1: value questions reach only consumers whose hello declares askValues beside askChoices; realfill-asks scores a value question's AskAsks.fallback as the automatic result and its scripted picks as 'after pick'.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"5dd3dcb4d8abfb74","sum":"VS1/helper: Disclosure caps at MAX_WAYS 8 (rebuilt minted requests need 'plan' shape); Ask value options state exact outputs (builders.ts optionIs); generation stops at MAX_GENERATOR_VISITS, not time; close page sessions before Helper.shutdown/Store.close.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"84a4af324deddcaf","sum":"VS1: Disclosure composes at most MAX_WAYS (8) ways; past that a text carries every reason, so a request rebuilt from verifier-minted parts needs 'plan' in its shape slot. Ask value options state exact outputs; stand-ins match them with builders.ts optionIs.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T103634Z-c66a1e426ad50081","text":"VS1: Disclosure composes at most MAX_WAYS (8) ways; past that a text carries every reason of its parts, so a request rebuilt after the verifier minted its parts as plan text needs 'plan' in its shape slot.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T103634Z-ffaa923aad520f1c","text":"VS1: an Ask's value options state exact outputs ('Proposed value: \"…\". Source: …'); test stand-ins match them with test/builders.ts optionIs, while a fill on focus keeps its quoted-candidate criteria.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"78a720eef0312ba1","sum":"Candidate generation stops at MAX_GENERATOR_VISITS, not elapsed time (no budgetMs or generator clock); a visit-cap stop still marks a partial window cut. Tests wiring page sessions into Helper close them before Helper.shutdown and Store.close.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T122806Z-20adf579b39b18f9","text":"Candidate generation stops at MAX_GENERATOR_VISITS, not elapsed time; no setGeneratorClock, budgetMs or --generator-clock override remains. stats.ms is diagnostic, and a visit-cap stop still marks a partial window cut.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T131449Z-7a0add213d3fc6e0","text":"Tests that wire page sessions into Helper must close those sessions before Helper.shutdown and Store.close; a scheduled trailing walk otherwise reaches a closed store.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
